.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-project-move - Move services into a project


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro project move  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Move services into a project

.PP
All ids must be your services within the key's scope, else 404 \fBservice_not_found\fR and nothing moves. Up to 500 per call; id 0 = default project. Sub-account keys need the \fBproject:move\fR action. Writes: 60 per minute per key (429 \fBrate_limited\fR).

.PP
API: POST /cloud/projects/{id}/services (operationId moveServicesToProject, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for move

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--service-ids\fP=[]
	service_ids

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)


